{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act24side_level_act24side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act24side",
  "stageId": "act24side_07",
  "title": "锥心之刺",
  "storyCode": "CF-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act24side/level_act24side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9ef503fe06b09926a2959e94ecc0652c224ec1449d85750835503e822f9df33d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "36_g8_minecavity"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真没想到，矿井里面会是这个样子，和火山地带好接近喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "尾巴感觉热热的喵——\n好烫！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喵！着火了喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "俺明白你想要关闭矿场的原因了，如果俺们见到了这样的情况确实也会立刻想办法阻止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这片矿场的开采已经过度了，甚至还建有源石加工车间，却完全没有使用专业化的平台器械......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些已经不是一个村庄可以控制的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "摸索开采，缺少严格防护的后果就是......活性源石的泄露，天灾的出现会是必然......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是俺不懂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "根据你说的，矿场是七年前开始开采的，带头的人是现在的村长，你的叔叔泷居应。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仅仅七年......怎么能够深入到这种程度？难道这些矿道是自己变出来的不成？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说对了一半。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "矿道并不是靠人力挖掘出来的，而是在开采之前就已经存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "记得我刚刚说的，七年前的兽潮吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "记得，你说七年前曾发生了一场严重的兽潮，柏生明......是柏生老爷子的儿子，也是一名猎人，就是在这场兽潮的袭击中牺牲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那场兽潮的发生，正是源自这片矿场的开采。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "学者猫，没事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "没事喵，是被什么绊倒了......\n喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "骨头！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好多骨头，还有牙齿，这是......爪子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死去很久了喵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喵，这种生物形态！是大型的肉食生物喵！第一次见！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从残骸来看，这种生物应该身披鳞甲，前肢发达，有长而尖锐的爪子，很有可能......善于掘洞喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "犰爪兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是它们的名字。犰爪兽是曾经栖息于这片山地的掠食者，具有社会性，会在山体中挖掘建造巢穴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些矿洞曾经就是它们的巢穴，历经岁月，它们在源石矿脉中穿行，修建起雄伟的宫殿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是无论在这里还是森林中，俺们并没有见到过犰爪兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是因为七年前......犰爪兽从这片森林里消失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "消失？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "消失喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们种族在这片森林的最后遗存，只剩下你们眼前的这堆骸骨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种事情......到底是怎么发生的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在源石矿被发现的早期，柏生明是开采的反对者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他认为破坏犰爪兽的巢穴可能会带来难以预料的负面影响，源石开采也伴有严重的危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我叔叔与其他村民则认为村子急需源石矿的利润来改变艰难的现状。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之后他瞒着柏生明，联合其他猎人，采用非常规的方式屠杀了巢穴内的全部犰爪兽，以便能进行开采活动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正是因为对犰爪兽的屠杀，剩余无家可归的犰爪兽愤怒地在森林中肆虐，直接导致了当年的兽潮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "竟然是这样，那么多无辜的生命......只是因为开采矿场而被杀害了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们一定见识过叔叔的态度了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在他看来，火龙简直是那些被他屠杀的生命归来，他一定会常常梦见柏生明哥哥的死吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的挚友，他的徒弟，贯彻猎人意志到最后一刻......为他而死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而现在柏生明哥哥的话已经应验了......他当然恐惧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为他而死？柏生明不是为了保护村子而......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兽潮进攻的方向并非村庄，柏生明哥哥被发现的地方远离村子，离矿场更近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他遭受了近乎疯狂的野兽围攻，其数量之多即使在兽潮中也远非正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我们到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在熔岩沸腾的矿井里，源石簇拥之处。\n天空王者抬起了它的头颅。\n渺小的鬼低头望去。\n他们的眼中倒映着彼此的目光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*东国感叹用粗口*。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它将大量的源石围在了自己身边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "注意不要离得太近，既然你们选择现在不处理它，那就保持这个状态就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是不小心激怒了它，我们会有大麻烦的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白。学者猫......你在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火龙......是用源石搭建了巢穴喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难以想象，难以想象喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它的样子......它很痛苦，是因为源石吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "应该是的，四周的源石粉尘比上一次看见它的时候更多了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它现在就是一个超大的污染源喵，飞到哪里源石粉尘就会洒在哪里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我猜测喵......火龙来到矿场，很有可能是为了寻找适合的环境，努力在这片陌生的土地上生存。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但在矿场深处，它的身躯难免会沾染源石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到它返回森林觅食，捕猎时喷出的火焰又会让携带的源石活性化，分解成细小的粉尘散播到环境中......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它也是源石的受害者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑角喵，你们一定要讨伐它吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石太危险了，考虑到村子和俺们自己的安危，狩猎它是俺们现在解决问题的最优手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果可以处理源石的话......给我一点时间喵！我拿望远镜观察一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有什么......有什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喵？那个痕迹是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "学者猫，快回来！你太靠前了，那边有点松动！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，哈，俺抓住你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喵——好可怕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑角！为什么不早提醒我喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "望远镜砸在火龙脑袋上了喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火龙的嘴边冒出火星了喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "两位快跑！矿场马上就要被破坏了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快跑喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快跑啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是整座矿场的源石都活性化了......绝对会加速的，结果就是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天灾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "36_g4_redleafcliff"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——哈，哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们太灵活了，我的斩击很容易被躲开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蠢货，你根本没有猎人的判断力，它的弱点是在下颚，那里有一块柔软的皮肤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刺进去，这样，就能割开它的喉咙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（六连斩！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斩中了！啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畜生，来尝尝这个！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "干掉了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "随从艾露猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_750_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二位，小心身后喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？！*东国粗口*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（二连斩！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不客气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚刚我的手......是脱力了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "随从艾露猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_750_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如潮水般源源不绝涌来的龙群，老夫只在某个村落旅行的途中听说过这样的场景，竟会在此地亲身陷入类似的情况......喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兽潮完全没有减弱的迹象，被困在这里我们迟早会力竭倒地，必须找到突围的办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那边有很多高大的树木，如果能到达那里的话就可以利用树冠在高处避开兽群前进的路径了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想到了一个办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能够引诱野兽的粉末，你们应该知道，我曾用这个试图引发角兽骚动来吸引出火龙，但因为超出剂量导致失控了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诱兽粉过去没有用在人的身上过，这就是自杀，但现在......想要改变如此多野兽的动向，或许只有这个才能起作用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是这样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "涂上诱兽粉的人会彻底陷入野兽的包围......只要能打开突破口，那就是值得的......我想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......工匠猫，那个绳子还有吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_751_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做了好多喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，够长......它的韧度足以承载数人的体重，可以作为钩索设置在那些大树上，再返回带人回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我来当诱饵，柏生先生你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，一定是我来当诱饵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，再度陷入野兽的包围实在太危险了，如果你再牺牲了，我来救你的行为不就毫无意义了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道凭我这样子有没有能力救你回来，但我至少在你回来之前绝对不会倒下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女娃子，你一定能救我回去的，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好，就这么办。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来啊！畜生们！来这边！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对，就是这样，疯狂地追逐我吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有机会！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（突进连斩！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_9998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗬——啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "随从艾露猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_750_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "成功了......喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赶快布置钩索，我去带柏生先生回来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些畜生像疯了一样，不管不顾地冲上来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兽潮的方向......真的改变了，不可思议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "成群的野兽，实在是太多了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那天......那天......七年前的兽潮，也是这样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "臭小子......那天晚上，你竟然是这样的吗？你是......因此而死的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是......你眼中所见吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些畜生将你团团包围，你能看到它们的牙齿，还有顺着嘴缝流下的口水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你肯定是这样，挥动着手上的矛，一只又一只杀死它们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但不管杀了多少，那些可恶的畜生还是会一波又一波地涌上来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——啊！给我滚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*东国粗口*，在它们眼里你已经不是活物了，你是一坨待它们分食的肉块，你能感觉到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且臭小子，就你那个性，肯定是一句话都不说吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你肯定还是挥舞着矛，直到筋疲力尽，连矛也抓不住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就靠着石头，想慢慢倒下......可那些畜生还是冲了过来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......原来真是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_9998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "柏生先生，我来了，抓住我的手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_9998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还愣着干什么？快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_9998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，抓住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_9998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "随从艾露猫，快拉绳子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "36_g3_redleafforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总算......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "随从艾露猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_750_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，夜刀阁下，那边......那些树被撞断了喵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "随从艾露猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_750_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更多的野兽朝这里冲来了喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*东国粗口*，还有什么办法吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "随从艾露猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_750_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夜刀阁下，快看，兽群突然散开了喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "随从艾露猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_750_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喵......来自......天空的声响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "随从艾露猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_750_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火龙在天上喵！那些是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*东国粗口*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天灾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "36_g6_redleafforestB"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "狂风擎住火焰贯穿天地，就像无智的生命侵噬一切。\n燃烧的涡流所至，树木宛如浮萍，山峦化作碎石。\n最无畏的勇士也无法奋起反抗，最虔诚的祈祷也没有任何回响。\n来了，是这片大地的责罚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "36_g6_redleafforestB"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冲击要来了！向下跳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "随从艾露猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_750_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫也一切正常......喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "燃烧的天空......赤红的火柱......*东国粗口*，还真唬人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我曾经在本舰看过类似的案例。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天灾引发的飓风裹挟着山火，变成了更凶恶的火焰风暴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "随着它的移动，涡流会将更多的东西吸入其中。而这森林里到处都是可燃物，后果......不堪设想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么......天灾会来得这么快？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "风暴所在的位置......是矿场附近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "矿场！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_9998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吃俺一刀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸！你们果然在这里！学者猫，瞧俺说什么来着......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑角，别贫嘴，稍后汇报情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好嘞，俺记得的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "柏生爷爷，你怎么会在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这该由我来问你，未来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然很难说是好事，但幸亏天灾的到来，我们才能脱离兽群的围困。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道现在村庄的情况如何，天灾的核心区域距离村庄还有相当一段距离，移动速度不算快，但是兽潮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要尽快返回村庄，各位有什么办法吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，在这附近的话......用那个！很快就可以下山了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已经很久没有用了，我不确定是否行得通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "俺没听懂，你们说的是什么哇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是轨道车啦，最初开掘矿场的时候，为了方便上山而铺设的，后来洞穴修好后就废弃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，绝对没问题，那可是我设计的第一个作品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是生态学者吗？居然会设计轨道车，俺有点紧张......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "柏生先生，可以预料到接下来的战斗只会更加艰难，希望您可以做好准备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女娃子，这次倒是没再让我一边歇着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您愿意的话当然也可以，我会尊重您的意见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有时候我确实过于坚持自己的意愿，而忽略了身边人的想法，这是我应该改正的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同样也是由于这个我犯下错误，我应该为先前对您说的话道歉，对不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在不了解真实背景的情况下，说出那些话的确无助于任务进展，反而对您造成了意料之外的伤害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您接受我的道歉吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦......随便你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女娃子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上次你说，你可以理解我......你的理由是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，这件事......有点说来话长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不方便就不必说了，当我什么也没问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，无妨。加入罗德岛前，我曾是一名杀手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "字面意义的杀手，听从命令夺去同类的性命，每天，每夜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直到有一天我突然看见自己血淋淋的双手，心里只觉得恐惧，第二天我的任务是处理掉一对母女，但我选择了保护她们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为我不想再做杀手了。也是那天我遇见了黑角，他听了我的话，也不做杀手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是我搞错了，不是自己不杀人就可以的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那对母女很怕我，我只好找了个安全的地方放她们走，当时心里只感到没有伤害他人的轻松，但我忘记了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么做的结果就是，她们会被后面找上门的杀手杀害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......很后悔吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，那之后的很长一段时间，我......经常梦到她们，问我为什么当时把她们留在那里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不想伤害无辜的人，却依旧导致了无辜的人死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我怀疑我是不是根本保护不了任何人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过幸好那时，我受到了帮助......多亏了他，我做出了决定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是那男娃子吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他少有地骂了我一顿，然后对我说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“过去就是过去......你所有的悔恨，所有的罪孽，就用全部的未来去弥补吧。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看上去怪老实的，脑袋精得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我觉得他说的对，就没再多想了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和他决定今后以保护他人为使命，他就拉着我一起加入了罗德岛，因为目标差不多，就一直干到现在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那企业能雇佣你们，本事也不小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们弥补过去的方式，就是保护他人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算是出发点吧，现在有了一些新的感悟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "时至今日我见过太多生死，人会以很多理由放弃自己的生命，或是因为无知而走向死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说我会把自己的意愿强加在别人身上，可关乎性命我只能这么做，我得让他们活着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "生命诞生于这片大地之上，并非为了轻易死去，活着才拥有全部的可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我必须竭尽全力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不愿再留下遗憾，不愿再见到还有人只能面对着一片废墟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不肯离去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夜刀！柏生先生！俺找到轨道车了，都还能用！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，你们都盯着俺看干嘛？俺的面罩沾上脏东西了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没什么，我们马上就过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "柏生先生，接下来的战斗，合作愉快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（伸出手）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说过多少遍，那是我的猎物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们只用在一旁看着，在精彩的片段好好鼓掌喝彩就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我当没有听见你说的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这不是一条容易的道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只能祝你好运了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同样，也祝你好运。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
